Package: reftip
Title: Hover Tooltips for Reference Links in altdoc and pkgdown Sites
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Date: 2026-08-27
Authors@R: person("Bjarke", "Hautop", email = "bjarke.hautop@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Adds hover tooltips to the function reference links that
    'altdoc' or 'pkgdown' create in a rendered R code block, showing the
    target's signature and a one-line summary. Runs as a post-processing
    step after `altdoc::render_docs()` or `pkgdown::build_site()`.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/BjarkeHautop/reftip
BugReports: https://github.com/BjarkeHautop/reftip/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    tools,
    fs
Suggests:
    altdoc,
    pkgdown,
    pkgload,
    quarto,
    rmarkdown,
    roxygen2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
